Package: a-nas-archive-keyring
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: A-NAS <zhongwater123@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: the key that signs the A-NAS apt repository
 /usr/share/keyrings/a-nas-archive-keyring.pgp, which the repository's
 .sources file names in Signed-By, so apt trusts this key for the A-NAS
 repository alone (docs/adr/0034). An example .sources file is in
 /usr/share/doc/a-nas-archive-keyring.
